        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=4$",
          "worked": "The angle opposite the diameter is $90^\\circ$ by Thales’s Theorem. By Pythagoras,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+3^2&=5^2\\\\x^2&=25-9\\\\x^2&=16\\\\x&=4.\\end{align*}$$",
