          "short": "$x=3\\sqrt2$",
          "worked": "The angle opposite the diameter is $90^\\circ$ by Thales’s Theorem. By Pythagoras,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+x^2&=6^2\\\\2x^2&=36\\\\x^2&=18\\\\x&=\\sqrt{18}\\\\x&=3\\sqrt2.\\end{align*}$$",
